WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:35.010
Episode 17

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:35.010
Knuckles! Clenched Fists of Anger

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.470
I met Hawk two months ago.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:11.060
I was traveling in the southern part of the continent in search of a Chaos Emerald.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.620
Help me!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.940
He was a treasure hunter, just like me.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.370
Hawk suddenly contacted me a week ago.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.500
He said that he found what I was looking for in this country.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.080
I came to Oriental City, Hawk's hometown.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.170
Excuse me, do you know the location of Fwan's shop?

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.840
I know you. You're Sonic, right?

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:25.100
Sonic? What part of me looks like Sonic?

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.930
I'm Knuckles!

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.440
I don't know you, but I know where Fwan's shop is.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.590
I'm looking for a man named Hawk.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.680
Is there something on my face?

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.810
No, it's just that you're a unique customer.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.060
I came because I heard Hawk was taken good care of here.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.480
No, there's no person here with that name.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:16.150
That's strange.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.770
Please give me a break, mister.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.230
Hey!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:27.070
A country has its own rules, a town has its own rules and a shop has its own rules.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:31.410
Interesting. So what are the rules here?

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.460
Search for your man somewhere else!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.090
Cut it out.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.340
You guys are no match for him.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.430
Mr. Yan.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.850
Hey, you.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.860
I have a name. Knuckles the Echidna.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.990
Excuse me for my rudeness, Knuckles.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.820
I hear you're looking for Hawk.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.620
Will you trust me and come with me?

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.830
Fine.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.880
It's Knuckles.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:29.180
This is a great scoop. Let's report this immediately to Dr. Eggman.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.600
Yeah.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.530
He's here?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.620
You go in first.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.330
Okay.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.730
Newcomer, there's food here but no freedom.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.020
And the food belongs to me.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.400
You never change, Hawk.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.740
Knuckles!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:33.450
Long time no see! I'm glad you're okay.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.000
I received an unusual reception.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.420
What? Knuckles is in Oriental City?

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:51.140
Well then, we're going to collect more information on the Chaos Emerald.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:55.430
Wait. My genius mind has another inspiration.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.890
I'm changing the plan.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.730
This is good.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.450
Are you sure it was the Chaos Emerald, Hawk?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:14.160
It was a red stone about this size.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.790
The Chaos Emerald.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:24.750
I have to return as soon as possible in order to protect the Master Emerald.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:31.630
Angel Island. Since when have I been living there?

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:37.180
By the time I realized it, I was protecting the Master Emerald.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.160
I was always alone.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.760
Then the time came.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:45.370
So if you collect them, you can get back to your world.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.580
I believe so.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:52.590
I see. Those guys and I mistakenly thought it was for money.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:56.970
That must have been rough. So where's the Chaos Emerald?

00:08:57.090 --> 00:09:02.770
Knuckles, they caught me after I contacted you. Therefore, it's still in the same place where I hid it.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.440
Where is it?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.480
It's in a great place. You see…

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:16.200
Actually, I'm a gourmet. It looks like this city has a lot of delicious food.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:21.660
There are lots of different types of food at the booths. All the delicious-smelling steam.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.670
Yes, steamed shrimp dumplings and leek buns.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.880
Crab shumai and shark fin meat buns.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:34.170
There are also radish rice cakes and almond jelly for dessert.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.220
For Oriental City, food equals love.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:41.430
We have a long four thousand-year history. But don't eat too much.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:46.270
Be careful of fat. Some foods are greasy.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.850
That's when you should drink oolong tea.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:52.520
These are the things we learned over four thousand years.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:57.950
Leek buns!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:02.950
What happened?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.450
Mr. Yan!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.090
How dare they!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.220
Taxi!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.520
Go.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.110
Take a right at the next corner.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.040
We're here.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.170
Where are we?

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:55.800
An old part of the city.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.140
Let's go.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.340
I found it at the place where my friends had their business transactions.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:44.720
I thought my mouth was going to burst out of my heart-

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.850
I mean, my heart was going to burst out of my mouth.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.730
It's over there.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.940
Right here.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.780
Here it is.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.200
The Chaos Emerald!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.910
I'm glad that I can pay you back for saving me.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:20.050
Long time no see, Knuckles. Be calm and give me the Chaos Emerald.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.680
Nonsense! I will never give you the Chaos Emerald!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.890
Egg ninja technique: Holography.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.310
Help me, Knuckles!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.940
You're...

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.990
Sometimes I'm a taxi driver, sometimes I'm a female guard.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.620
At other times, I'm a sexy dancer.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:52.620
But my true identity is E-91, Kunoichi!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.370
A woman?

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.000
You're too soft, Knuckles.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.840
A Kunoichi forsakes being a woman. This is the secret of the ninja.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.170
Eggman, where are you?

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:10.720
E-91, get the Chaos Emerald!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.240
Egg ninja technique: 16 Tons.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.300
Hawk! Get the Chaos Emerald!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.230
What's the matter?

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.400
The Chaos Emerald is under this.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:11.700
Hitting me from behind? I won't forgive you for that.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.670
This looks bad.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.170
I should retreat for now.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.520
We have no choice. We need to escape.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.730
But how?

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:12.930
In regards to last night's subway collapse, eyewitnesses say they saw the Egg Fort.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:17.600
The government believes Dr. Eggman was involved.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.890
We can't do anything for awhile.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.810
We should dig it out after things settle down.

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:26.820
If we waste time, he'll get a hold of it.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:28.530
Damn!

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:36.540
Are you all right, Knuckles?

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:53.760
This is…

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:54.890
Shovel Claw.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.850
Why is it here in this world?

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.770
Don't you remember? They're relics from when you saved my life, Knuckles.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.740
I see.

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.200
What about them?

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.050
Be careful.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.900
It should be around here.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.040
Hawk! Hawk, where are you?

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:09.500
Knuckles, I have a message for you from Dr. Eggman.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:14.550
If you want to save him, come to Orient New Town. Understood?

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:22.220
After the message is delivered, the robot will automatically start doing karate.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.980
Direct Hell Kick!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:30.610
You're pretty good. It's amazing you dodged my kick.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.190
Farewell!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.050
Knuckles!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:58.010
I hope you brought the Chaos Emerald, Knuckles.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.390
Throw it over here.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:17.240
Egg ninja technique: Kite.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.860
Thank you.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.870
Give me back the Chaos Emerald.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.090
You must be kidding. I finally got a hold of it.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:38.130
Oh no!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.430
Over there!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:45.100
Egg ninja technique: Flying Squirrel.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:15.210
With all this commotion, I have no choice but to give up.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.820
Egg ninja technique: Too Bad.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:45.030
Sorry to keep you waiting. Now give me back the Chaos Emerald.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.800
Egg ninja technique: Electric Bind.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.100
Master Emerald.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.020
Knuckles!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.320
Give up.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:59.440
So you're leaving on another journey.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:00.860
Yeah.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.110
We'll meet again someday, won't we?

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.130
Until next time, partner!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:22.920
Partner…

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.720
Knuckles!

00:21:57.870 --> 00:21:59.080
Where am I?

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:08.180
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.970
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.310
What does that mean?

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:36.540
What was that?

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:43.170
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.460 --> 00:25:35.430
Huge Battle on the Savanna!
